      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCE IS GAME (5) was a month between runs and back in trip with a surprise victory from the wide draw over 1800m at Port Macquarie. Drops in weight from the rails draw and sure to be thereabouts again. PURPLE KITTY (6) is holding his form and saves his best for this track. Kept finding when second over 1800m at Port Macquarie. Drops in weight and proven at the trip. PELEVECCHIO (4) has been in the market at her last couple of starts but hasn't made an impression. Should appreciate the extra ground after chipping away late when seventh over 1808m at Port Macquarie. Place preferred. THINKIN' BO YOU (7) caught the eye late with a respectable fifth in the Port Macquarie Cup Prelude over 1808m. Place only.",
